    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTown Centre First Floor Two-Bedroom Apartment\n\nIdeally situated in the heart of Clonmel town centre, Apartment 1, 14 Market Street offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a convenient town residence. Located on the first floor, this well-positioned apartment enjoys immediate access to an excellent range of local amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, public transport, and all the services the town has to offer.\n\nThe accommodation is well laid out and comprises an entrance hallway, open plan kitchen sitting and dining room, two well-proportioned bedrooms, and a family bathroom.\n\nIts central location provides the convenience of town centre living, with every amenity on your doorstep while offering comfortable and practical accommodation throughout.\n\nThis property represents an attractive opportunity to acquire a centrally located apartment in one of County Tipperary's principal towns, making it equally suitable as a private residence or investment property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 1.70m x 3.48m\n\n\nKitchen - 1.98m x 1.75m\n\n\nSitting/Dining Room - 7.09m x 3.15m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.06m x 3.98m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.24m x 3.17m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.01m x 2.33m\n\n\n"
